laurel 2956: a panic ends in a reset on every path with laurelpanic=N, also with no USB, with debug=0xc, and before SweetPlatformExpert::start (hook in panic_spin_forever); panic word in the IMEM restart word for the boot menu. Both kernels. docs/laurel_sprout/boot-menu.md.

